### Create a group-link command as an authorized panel administrator.
### A personal Telegram identity link is not required for the workspace operator.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chats/link-token
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Response: { "command": "/link@your_bot TOKEN", "expiresAt": "..." }
### Send the returned command in the intended group within ten minutes.
### The sender must be an active workspace member and a Telegram group admin.
### A new command replaces previous tokens. Linking enables collection of received
### group messages and records the group administrator and time. The dialog explains
### the default before redemption. Linking does not grant membership or an admin role.
### Collection can be disabled in Group access; Telegram controls message visibility.

### Inspect the saved group after the bot confirms "Group linked".
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chats
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
